cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "0xdx: A Self-Operating, Committee-Driven DAO Governance Framework"
abstract: >-
  0xdx is a self-operating, committee-driven DAO governance framework.
  Elected committees decide one-person-one-vote, smart contracts
  auto-execute the outcomes, and a built-in DEX funds the treasury so
  the DAO runs perpetually without external fundraising. The
  specification covers governance architecture, proposal lifecycle,
  treasury system, security and safeguards, identity and Sybil
  resistance, and legal posture.
message: "If you reference, build on, or fork this specification, please cite it."
type: software
